Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.72,0:00:02.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园先生）为赢得精彩胜利的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.98,0:00:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗送上祝福！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.69,0:00:08.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}准决胜　进出决定！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 他也紧随托隆之后\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确定晋级半决赛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.54,0:00:11.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩下的席位还有两个！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}究竟谁会一路赢到最后呢！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.12,0:00:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全世界决斗粉丝的心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定也燃烧起来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.98,0:00:20.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 大家一起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.81,0:00:23.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（大家）心之燃烧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.79,0:00:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）我要告诉他们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.83,0:00:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管是托隆还是菲卡博士！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.27,0:00:32.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把自己的孩子当成复仇的工具{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.12,0:00:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对不会原谅！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.48,0:00:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.26,0:00:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 从左边传来了一股强烈的波动……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.33,0:00:43.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}波动？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.20,0:00:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是从{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那里感觉到的纹章的力量？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.63,0:00:50.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是这样的话 那托隆就在那里！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.78,0:00:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可能性… 是有的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.89,0:00:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～ 走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.07,0:01:05.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 这里是岩浆场地！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.92,0:01:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降临在这灼热场地的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:09.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}究竟会是谁呢！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.47,0:01:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（沙智）鲨鱼！好帅！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.79,0:01:22.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）真是的！不是游马就没意思喵～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.14,0:01:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凌牙）终于抓到你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.66,0:01:28.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次 绝不会再让你逃掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.70,0:01:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）哼 说得真难听。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.26,0:01:34.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可不是在逃。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.26,0:01:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只是装作那样把你引过来罢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.93,0:01:39.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}引到这灼热的岩浆场地。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.35,0:01:44.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）在这热与火的世界里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.50,0:01:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你可是处于压倒性的不利哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.71,0:01:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为 你的卡组是水属性。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.21,0:01:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的怪兽也是在这里活不下去的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.03,0:01:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（赛）呀——{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.57,0:01:59.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天也请多多关照！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.43,0:02:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）什么关照啊。那帮家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.29,0:02:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根本不知道那家伙的真面目！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.04,0:02:04.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的真面目也就是说……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.45,0:02:07.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是恶魔！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.25,0:02:10.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.77,0:02:13.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻我就拿下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.26,0:02:14.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.45,0:02:17.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}灼热的岩浆场地吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.92,0:02:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别小看我！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.42,0:02:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 速攻魔法板块打捞！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.37,0:02:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据其效果 在2个回合内
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.67,0:02:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使场地魔法无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.90,0:02:32.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.68,0:02:40.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼 还有{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:43.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.39,0:02:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了吗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.31,0:02:48.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）不过 这里就是岩浆场地？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.92,0:02:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}完全 一点都不热嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.09,0:02:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈 哈啾！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.90,0:02:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不愧是鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.72,0:02:55.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来是用魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.73,0:02:57.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把场地魔法停下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.55,0:02:59.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.34,0:03:01.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵… 终于开始了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.33,0:03:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）这对{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和凌牙来说都是重要的一战…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.28,0:03:08.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 尽情地战斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.48,0:03:11.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会好好看着的。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.39,0:04:48.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤三脚鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.68,0:05:01.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 自己场上有鱼族怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.25,0:05:04.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙可以从手牌特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.43,0:05:07.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！ 鲨鱼·射手！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.92,0:05:13.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级3的怪兽有2只！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.27,0:05:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说突然就来！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.73,0:05:16.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.68,0:05:19.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 等级3的三脚鱼和
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.81,0:05:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼·足球员进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.91,0:05:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.13,0:05:31.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧潜航母舰 航空鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.79,0:05:34.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动航空鲨的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.39,0:05:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}取除1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.90,0:05:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1张手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.84,0:05:41.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就给对手造成400点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.43,0:05:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的手牌是3张。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.96,0:05:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此造成1200点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.39,0:05:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.67,0:05:57.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第1回合就给对手效果伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.34,0:06:00.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然 好厉害啊 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.91,0:06:04.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 干得好 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.25,0:06:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底我们 是你的伙伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.88,0:06:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖上两张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.12,0:06:18.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵。一上来就{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤出怪兽超量，真是有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.71,0:06:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.73,0:06:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}值得击溃啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.59,0:06:23.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.77,0:06:25.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的场上没有怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.70,0:06:27.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤了怪兽超量的情况下{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.51,0:06:30.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关傀儡 磁力人偶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.56,0:06:32.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.46,0:06:35.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（磁力人偶）磁～力！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.12,0:06:37.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，我还要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.85,0:06:40.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤机关傀儡 齿轮变速者！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.75,0:06:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.36,0:06:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以和场上的机关傀儡变成{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相同的等级。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.89,0:06:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}齿轮升级！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.66,0:06:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}齿轮变速者！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.61,0:06:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相同等级的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.93,0:06:56.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就有2只了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.47,0:06:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.50,0:06:58.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.74,0:07:01.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级８的 机关傀儡 磁力人偶和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.52,0:07:04.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关傀儡 齿轮变速者进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.77,0:07:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用２只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.91,0:07:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.49,0:07:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.41,0:07:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.１５！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.76,0:07:20.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关傀儡 巨人杀手！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.48,0:07:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是…！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.25,0:07:23.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于出来了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.24,0:07:26.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把铁男和委员长打伤的 No.！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.14,0:07:33.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要是动真格来的话我也奉陪到底。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.78,0:07:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最棒的粉丝服务就让你见识见识吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.73,0:07:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？那只怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.23,0:07:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大人？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.59,0:07:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～ 这是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.03,0:07:48.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底 是怎么回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.76,0:07:50.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙 对 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场粉丝瞩目的一战{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.18,0:07:52.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然如此失态！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.95,0:07:55.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的心也快要被愤怒引爆了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.74,0:07:58.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心碎…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.52,0:08:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是那群家伙干的好事吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.52,0:08:05.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵 抱歉啦～。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来这段我觉得实在不堪入目{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.85,0:08:10.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我就把摄像机弄坏了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.76,0:08:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 动手吧 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.69,0:08:16.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把凌牙打进黑暗之中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.01,0:08:18.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}狠狠击落吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.53,0:08:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关傀儡 巨人杀手的怪兽效果\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.14,0:08:28.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏场上的怪兽超量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个攻击力数值的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.83,0:08:29.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对手！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.11,0:08:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.28,0:08:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.46,0:08:53.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 我还要
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.63,0:08:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用机关傀儡 巨人杀手{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.35,0:09:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续陷阱 泡沫使者！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.11,0:09:03.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.52,0:09:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效对方怪兽的直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.50,0:09:08.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼～ 防住了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.41,0:09:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧 嘛 无所谓。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.05,0:09:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要我 回合结束
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.49,0:09:13.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打捞板的效果也会消失。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.32,0:09:16.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来就是 灼热地狱了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 就这样 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.76,0:09:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？ 哎呀～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.55,0:09:32.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的是 灼热地狱啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.36,0:09:35.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 场地魔法 熔岩之海。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:41.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是不是在逞强看完我的决斗再说吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.49,0:09:44.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.16,0:09:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 召唤锤头鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.83,0:09:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动 泡沫使者的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.37,0:09:55.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这张卡送去墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.22,0:09:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为代替{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将三脚鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.94,0:09:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.08,0:10:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤成功时
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.37,0:10:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}三脚鱼怪兽的等级{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上升1级！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.07,0:10:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蠢货！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.27,0:10:13.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场地魔法 岩浆之海是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在召唤水属性怪兽时
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.74,0:10:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.58,0:10:18.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的怪兽在这里是活不下去的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.33,0:10:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.87,0:10:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.26,0:10:32.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.38,0:10:33.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是陷阱卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.71,0:10:35.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在鲨鱼的场上发动了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.41,0:10:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.27,0:10:41.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续陷阱 逆境适应！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.71,0:10:44.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以无效 由魔法 陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.09,0:10:45.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对怪兽的破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.91,0:10:48.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 我的怪兽 就能在这
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.93,0:10:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}灼热地狱中忍耐下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.04,0:10:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害！ 不愧是 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.79,0:10:57.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他对这一战所倾注的 那份决心可不是闹着玩的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.59,0:11:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}…我跟你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.44,0:11:04.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在全国大赛上被你设下陷阱{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.50,0:11:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.64,0:11:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连毫无关系的妹妹都被你伤害了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.95,0:11:10.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.80,0:11:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会原谅你！》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.45,0:11:18.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管用什么手段我都要打倒你！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.07,0:11:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，他动真格了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.43,0:11:22.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等，不会吧，鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.49,0:11:24.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因泡泡携带者的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.86,0:11:26.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.75,0:11:28.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将变成2个超量素材！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.67,0:11:30.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用变成2个的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.56,0:11:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}三脚鱼和锤头鲨{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.62,0:11:34.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用锤头鲨{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.07,0:11:36.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.25,0:11:38.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.73,0:11:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.32！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.20,0:11:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海咬龙 鲨鱼龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.76,0:11:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是 那时候的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.43,0:12:00.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.27,0:12:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赐予凌牙的 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.06,0:12:07.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}按照我的命令。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.98,0:12:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙。\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直在等这一刻。\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.42,0:12:16.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了让你心之暗扩散得更多更多！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.69,0:12:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.50,0:12:23.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在谋划什么我虽然知道{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.60,0:12:26.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}利用{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} 把这张 No.给凌牙！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.42,0:12:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没跟你说过就是了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.59,0:12:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.88,0:12:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为 要是跟你说了 计划
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.05,0:12:35.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可能会泄露出去吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.12,0:12:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毕竟你嘴不严嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:42.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人各有各自的职责啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.82,0:12:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}V有V的。{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.80,0:12:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的…我的职责是？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.38,0:12:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把凌牙打入心之暗之中。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.57,0:12:57.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到目前为止都很顺利。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.91,0:12:59.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正如我的计划。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.75,0:13:02.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把他逼到这个地步{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.55,0:13:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}引来鲨鱼龙这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.46,0:13:06.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也是按你的计划来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.24,0:13:07.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.45,0:13:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是掉以轻心，你也会有危险哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.39,0:13:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙的力量也好，鲨鱼龙的力量也好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.16,0:13:19.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不是很清楚吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.63,0:13:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙的力量？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.01,0:13:25.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！鲨鱼龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.58,0:13:28.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击机关傀儡 巨型杀手！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.47,0:13:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，我还要发动鲨鱼龙的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.15,0:13:38.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.33,0:13:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将破坏的机关傀儡 巨人杀手的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.82,0:13:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力下降1000点{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.83,0:13:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤到{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的场上！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.04,0:13:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要让敌人的怪兽回来？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.51,0:13:52.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃，那个是……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.39,0:13:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼龙通过那个效果
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.51,0:13:58.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以再一次进行攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.87,0:14:00.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这么回事，小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.46,0:14:01.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.31,0:14:03.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的剩余生命值是1500。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.40,0:14:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一击通过的话，鲨鱼就赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.13,0:14:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……不会让你得逞的！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.55,0:14:14.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.21,0:14:16.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤机关傀儡 夜小丑！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.51,0:14:21.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（夜小丑）嗨～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.25,0:14:25.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）这张卡可以
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.44,0:14:29.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除外墓地的巨人杀手{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再一次进行攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.90,0:14:34.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）好险啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.59,0:14:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，你临场的应对很不错哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.20,0:14:39.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来你还能继续战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.46,0:14:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能把凌牙更加更加
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.71,0:14:44.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}逼入绝境{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这么回事吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.64,0:14:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}捡回一条命了啊，{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.16,0:14:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样回合结束…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.43,0:14:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看你看凌牙也还精神得很呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.74,0:14:54.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得加把劲才行！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.08,0:14:56.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）我知道！！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.47,0:14:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.95,0:15:00.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}…在跟谁说话！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.21,0:15:03.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.12,0:15:06.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的任务就是把凌牙打入心之暗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.35,0:15:07.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}之中。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.29,0:15:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了这个，至今为止…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.81,0:15:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在大会上陷害那家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.68,0:15:14.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}害他妹妹受伤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.22,0:15:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都是为了特隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.72,0:15:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过是遵从特隆的命令罢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.04,0:15:21.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎…特隆的命令！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.22,0:15:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.40,0:15:27.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在吗，托隆！？现身吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.09,0:15:28.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.41,0:15:30.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.55,0:15:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆在那里！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.84,0:15:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕是用了某种力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.52,0:15:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只让他一个人看到了自己的幻影吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.16,0:15:40.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.71,0:15:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不愧是星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.98,0:15:45.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆！你的目的是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.91,0:15:47.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把鲨鱼逼入绝境{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.52,0:15:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让他落入心之暗你这么做{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.08,0:15:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是为了什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.00,0:15:53.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也没必要隐瞒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.24,0:15:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就回答所有人吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.40,0:16:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要让凌牙的心落入黑暗的理由是……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.48,0:16:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了操控他。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.21,0:16:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为打倒Dr.菲卡的刺客。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.65,0:16:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刺客！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.28,0:16:14.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了！那种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.11,0:16:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不打算当！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.47,0:16:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算你没有那个意思也已经逃不掉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.53,0:16:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你会成为我的傀儡。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.37,0:16:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只属于我的人偶。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.58,0:16:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们兄弟一直为了托隆竭尽全力！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.49,0:16:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可为什么不是我们……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.21,0:16:33.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，为什么不是我而是凌牙！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.80,0:16:35.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种事我绝不认同！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.59,0:16:38.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说过了吧人是有各自的角色的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.93,0:16:41.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要打倒Dr.菲卡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.58,0:16:44.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比起你，凌牙更……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.03,0:16:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不认同！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.95,0:16:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种事我绝对不认同！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.71,0:16:51.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Dr.菲卡由我来打倒！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.95,0:16:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）我要让这家伙知道{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.51,0:16:55.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我比他更强给我看好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.64,0:16:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.85,0:17:03.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动魔法卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}傀儡仪式 机关傀儡仪式！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.40,0:17:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.98,0:17:10.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将墓地中自己名为机关傀儡的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼唤回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.08,0:17:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！机关傀儡 磁力人偶！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.70,0:17:19.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}磁～力！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.72,0:17:20.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级８的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.59,0:17:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关傀儡 夜小丑和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.80,0:17:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关傀儡 磁力人偶进行叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.31,0:17:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用２只暗属性怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.03,0:17:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.00,0:17:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.10,0:17:36.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.４０！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.86,0:17:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关傀儡 天堂弦乐手！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.15,0:17:50.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我再从手牌{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动装备魔法 命运之弦{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.72,0:17:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备给机关傀儡 天堂弦乐手！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.04,0:18:02.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡从卡组把卡送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.48,0:18:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果那是怪兽卡的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.53,0:18:07.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能进行那只怪兽等级次数的攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.16,0:18:11.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且你的怪兽不会被破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.35,0:18:14.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我抽到的是等级8的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.03,0:18:16.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关傀儡 死灵人偶。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.27,0:18:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 对鲨鱼龙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.32,0:18:24.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连续攻击8次。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.85,0:18:26.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.20,0:18:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}8次连续攻击！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.97,0:18:30.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！天堂弦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.34,0:18:32.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}天堂之刃！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.26,0:18:44.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.40,0:18:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为命运之弦的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.59,0:18:48.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽不会被破坏，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.10,0:18:51.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而是要承受连续攻击带来的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伤害吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.87,0:18:53.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}继续吧 天堂弦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.20,0:18:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}狠狠折磨鲨鱼龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.65,0:19:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}痛苦吧 更加痛苦吧 凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.62,0:19:11.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 怎么会这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.28,0:19:14.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手 这根本就不是决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.75,0:19:17.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗不是为了愤怒和复仇才去做的事！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.37,0:19:19.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会让你妨碍我的。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.54,0:19:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}动不了…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.50,0:19:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.93,0:19:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来才是真正的好戏。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.88,0:19:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就在那里乖乖看着吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.14,0:19:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要！ 快住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.83,0:19:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗是让人幸福的东西！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.61,0:19:42.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}痛苦吧 凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.22,0:19:44.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}痛苦吧痛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.39,0:19:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}痛苦到最后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}坠入地狱去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.86,0:19:49.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是第5次了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.64,0:19:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明只要进行决斗 大家就能成为同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.91,0:19:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为朋友…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.98,0:19:59.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伤害别人什么的才不是决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.81,0:20:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家都是朋友呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.80,0:20:04.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你真的很像呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.69,0:20:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和那个九十九一马。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.40,0:20:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.77,0:20:14.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他也经常说什么友情啦、让人幸福啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.65,0:20:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你们 是你们要不是你们把我爸卷进来……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.55,0:20:19.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.86,0:20:22.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从你身边夺走爸爸的是Dr.费卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.45,0:20:25.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要恨的话就去恨费卡吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.55,0:20:30.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来你的心中也会生出黑暗。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.73,0:20:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把它扩散开来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.07,0:20:34.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵……说好了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.32,0:20:37.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下次我要吃掉你的心。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.75,0:20:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.80,0:20:40.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝不原谅你！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.88,0:20:43.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把德鲁瓦逼到那种地步你这个人！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.99,0:20:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当成复仇工具的你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.26,0:20:50.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不错 越来越浓了心之暗！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.20,0:20:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}仇恨会让黑暗增幅恨我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.09,0:20:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恨Dr.菲卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.04,0:20:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闭嘴～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.34,0:20:59.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 最后一击了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.44,0:21:06.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样 凌牙但是 还没结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.30,0:21:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关傀儡 天堂弦乐的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.36,0:21:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.40,0:21:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.36,0:21:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在鲨鱼龙上放置弦计数器。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.60,0:21:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来在下个回合结束时
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.33,0:21:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼龙会被破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.43,0:21:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那份原本攻击力数值的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.71,0:21:43.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你将承受下来。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.55,0:21:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是真正的永别了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.52,0:21:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 就这样回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.93,0:21:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.63,0:21:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼 你回句话啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.21,0:21:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 你听得见吧 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.81,0:21:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.95,0:21:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼他 不会吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.01,0:22:04.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！

Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.57,0:24:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天介绍的是 No.32 鲨鱼龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.79,0:24:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将击败的怪兽重新召唤并攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.40,0:24:18.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝不让猎物逃脱真是符合鲨鱼的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.03,0:24:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.44,0:24:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？ 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.24,0:24:23.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解说太长了根本插不进段子啊！

